     "source": "s1",
     "quote": "Magnus Hirschfeld stammte aus einer jüdischen Familie und war der Sohn des Kolberger Arztes Hermann Hirschfeld (1825–1885), der für seine Verdienste im Sanitätsdienst während des Deutsch-Französischen Krieges zum Sanitätsrat ernannt wurde.",
     "quoteLang": "de",
     "verbatim": true,
     "verifiedAt": "2026-10-23T06:30:09.877Z"
    }
   ],
   "by": "crawler",
   "run": "evidence-crawl-2026-10-23",
   "note": "answer check: “Magnus Hirschfeld” is on the snapshot of s1"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7",
   "at": "2026-10-23T06:30:09.877Z",
   "target": "f12438",
   "claim": "answer",
   "verdict": "confirmed",
   "confidence": "medium",
   "support": [
    {
     "source": "s2",
     "quote": "The group aimed to undertake research to defend the rights of homosexuals and to repeal Paragraph 175, the section of the German penal code that, since 1871, had criminalized homosexuality.",
     "quoteLang": "en",
     "verbatim": true,
     "verifiedAt": "2026-10-23T06:30:09.877Z"
    }
   ],
   "by": "crawler",
   "run": "evidence-crawl-2026-10-23",
   "note": "answer check: “Paragraph 175” is on the snapshot of s2"
  },
